[34.008, "o", "Plan kyoto: scanning and hashing its 2 items ...\r\n"]
[34.02, "o", "Categories from Match rules in ~/.arv/config/sets.rec: VIDEO (--category to choose, --no-rules to skip)\r\n"]
[34.032, "o", "Classified as: MEMORIES/PHOTO/TRIP, MEMORIES/VIDEO\r\n"]
[34.044, "o", "Object DCIM/ (data/Photos on TRIP-01_2025_B): new\r\n"]
[34.056, "o", "Object kyoto-walk.mp4 (data/kyoto-walk.mp4 on TRIP-01_2025_B): new\r\n"]
[34.068, "o", "The image will take 17.4 MiB in all, with 13.2 GiB free there: RS03 error correction fills it to its medium\r\n"]
[34.08, "o", "  (--no-ecc: just the files, to try arv out)\r\n"]
[34.092, "o", "Building ~/images/TRIP-01_2025_B.iso (1 of 1, 3.0 MiB) ...\r\n"]
[34.104, "o", "Adding RS03 error correction ...\r\n"]
[34.116, "o", "Testing the image ...\r\n"]
[34.128, "o", "Hashing ~/images/TRIP-01_2025_B.iso ...\r\n"]
[34.14, "o", "Next: burn each image as it is (one session, closed: docs/burning.md), then read it back and record it:\r\n"]
[34.152, "o", "  xorriso -as cdrecord -v dev=/dev/sr0 -eject ~/'images/TRIP-01_2025_B.iso'\r\n"]
[34.164, "o", "  arv burned TRIP-01_2025_B --device /dev/sr0 --location PLACE\r\n"]
[34.176, "o", "  (and a warm copy, if you like: copy the image to a NAS, then arv stored TRIP-01_2025_B PATH --location PLACE)\r\n"]
[34.188, "o", "TRIP-01_2025_B  ~/images/TRIP-01_2025_B.iso  Kyoto, July 2025\r\n"]
